  "uploadNotes": "The cycleDuration is longer than the AgeAtSalughter because the cycle starts from the fetus of the animal to be slaughtered ( includes 250 days of pregnancy). 'The urea, plastic and brick inputs to the farmed system were not included in the deer rearing cycle as they were assumed to be used for the construction of the forage garden, which would be a separate site & cycle.",
